<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><gpx version="1.1" creator="The Gunks Gravel Escape" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>Spring Farm and the northern Mohonk carriage roads · Sky lakes &amp; Clove Valley</name><desc>Start at Creek Road / Kyserike Road, near the inn. Friday uses a different ridge entrance and a different branch through the fields. Continue south from Water Street Market to finish at the Locust Lane curb.</desc><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>OpenStreetMap linework</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bike-Map-2024.pdf"><text>Designated ridge bicycle routes</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/where/new-york/shawangunks/river-to-ridge-trail"><text>River-to-Ridge map</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/recreation-activities/mountain-biking/"><text>Mountain House carriage roads</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/news/lake-awosting-restoration"><text>Lake Awosting loop reopening</text></link><link href="https://parks.ny.gov/visit/state-parks/minnewaska-state-park-preserve"><text>Minnewaska map and cycling conditions</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonkpreserve.org/plan-your-visit/"><text>Cycling day pass and hours</text></link><link href="https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?lat=41.736&amp;lon=-74.197"><text>Current point forecast</text></link><link href="https://511ny.org/"><text>Road incidents and traffic</text></link><link href="https://www.dot.ny.gov/divisions/engineering/technical-services/hds-respository/NYSDOT_2025_LHI_Local_Roads_and_Streets_Ulster_County.pdf"><text>Local road surfaces</text></link><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>How the ride was measured</text></link><link href="https://data.usgs.gov/datacatalog/data/USGS%3A3a81321b-c153-416f-98b7-cc8e5f0e17c3"><text>Elevation estimates</text></link></metadata><wpt lat="41.797085" lon="-74.178207"><name>1. Alligerville · Kyserike at Creek Road</name><desc>From the public Creek / Kyserike junction near the inn, take County Route 6 south over Rondout Creek. Use your host’s directions to reach this meeting point.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.795954" lon="-74.176049"><name>2. Berme Road</name><desc>At the fork bear left onto Berme Road east along the creek. Leave County Route 6 here.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.805667" lon="-74.155006"><name>3. Cherry Hill Road</name><desc>Turn sharply right onto Cherry Hill Road heading south.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.801498" lon="-74.155506"><name>4. Old Clove Road</name><desc>Turn left onto Old Clove Road. Follow it southeast to Clove Chapel.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.792971" lon="-74.143801"><name>5. Clove Chapel · Clove Road</name><desc>Merge east onto Clove Road toward Mohonk Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.791866" lon="-74.140767"><name>6. Mohonk Road climb</name><desc>Turn right onto Mohonk Road and climb east. Continue on the winding paved county road for about 0.9 mi.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.791897" lon="-74.130279"><name>7. Upper 27 Knolls Road</name><desc>Turn left onto Upper 27 Knolls Road for Spring Farm.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.794652" lon="-74.128479"><name>8. Spring Farm visitor entrance</name><desc>Bear into the signed Spring Farm vehicle entrance and continue to the trailhead booth for a cycling pass.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.794991" lon="-74.128096"><name>9. Spring Farm trailhead · Friday check-in</name><desc>Obtain today’s cycling pass or show an All Access membership and sign the waiver. Continue on the gravel Spring Farm entrance drive and watch for vehicles.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.796513" lon="-74.123155"><name>10. Spring Farm carriage-road entrance</name><desc>Continue along the signed Spring Farm carriage road toward Cedar Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.794453" lon="-74.123276"><name>11. Turn onto Cedar Drive</name><desc>Take Cedar Drive toward the northeast loop, leaving Spring Farm Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.796231" lon="-74.117921"><name>12. Cedar Drive Loop</name><desc>Bear onto the signed outer Cedar Drive Loop. Return to the main Cedar Drive afterward.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.789936" lon="-74.122211"><name>13. Bonticou / Cedar junction</name><desc>Take the short Bonticou connector, then follow Cedar Drive toward Guyot Hill Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.788278" lon="-74.123079"><name>14. Guyot Hill Road</name><desc>Turn onto Guyot Hill Road and follow its winding course through the old ski area. Stay on Guyot past Pine Water Reservoir Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.780308" lon="-74.130927"><name>15. Bonticou Road</name><desc>Follow Bonticou toward the Mountain Rest Road end. At Spring Farm Road head north on the carriage road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.788571" lon="-74.126398"><name>16. Bonticou Road · ridge traverse</name><desc>Leave Spring Farm Road for Bonticou Road westbound. Cross Mountain Rest Road on the signed carriage-road crossing.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.775628" lon="-74.142194"><name>17. Old Glen Anna Road</name><desc>Turn off Bonticou onto Old Glen Anna Road to Cedar Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.777629" lon="-74.143707"><name>18. Cedar Drive · west</name><desc>Take Cedar Drive west to Mossy Brook Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.777335" lon="-74.148216"><name>19. Mossy Brook Road</name><desc>Turn southwest onto Mossy Brook and continue to North Lookout. Walk the brief section through the resort drives and watch for vehicles.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.771691" lon="-74.154615"><name>20. North Lookout Road</name><desc>Join North Lookout Road toward the Hemlock Lane junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.776545" lon="-74.146851"><name>21. Hemlock Lane</name><desc>Follow Hemlock Lane downhill toward Huguenot Drive. Watch for resort traffic at the auto-road crossing.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.773043" lon="-74.145469"><name>22. Huguenot Drive</name><desc>Turn south onto Huguenot Drive toward Bridge Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.77006" lon="-74.14503"><name>23. Bridge Road</name><desc>Take Bridge Road / Kleine Kill Road to Forest Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.766641" lon="-74.146435"><name>24. Forest Drive</name><desc>Turn toward Home Farm Circle on Forest Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.76106" lon="-74.15535"><name>25. Home Farm Drive</name><desc>Follow Home Farm Drive and Old Minnewaska Road west to the Rhododendron Bridge junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.758259" lon="-74.165169"><name>26. Oakwood Drive descent</name><desc>At the near end of Rhododendron Bridge, take Oakwood Drive downhill. Continue through its bends and keep to Oakwood at the Old Stage and Duck Pond forks.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764665" lon="-74.140982"><name>27. Oakwood / Lenape Lane</name><desc>Follow Lenape Lane south and downhill toward the Foothills.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>28. Foothills · River-to-Ridge</name><desc>Turn onto River-to-Ridge rather than continuing east to the stone Gateway.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>29. Pine Road crossing</name><desc>Cross at the marked River-to-Ridge crossing. Follow posted construction controls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>30. Butterville Road crossing</name><desc>Cross to the field trail and follow it toward the Wallkill River.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751616" lon="-74.118573"><name>31. Southern field loop</name><desc>Take the southern branch across the field. It meets Thursday’s track again before Springtown Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>32. Springtown Road crossing</name><desc>Cross the road toward the river; follow the riverside path south to the bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>33. Carmine Liberta Bridge</name><desc>Use the separated bridge path east and walk the short village sidewalk to Water Street Market.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>34. Water Street Market · south on the rail trail</name><desc>At the marked Main Street crossing, turn south on the Wallkill Valley Rail Trail toward Plains Road and Locust Lane. Turn right from the Main Street north sidewalk and walk the bike south across the marked unsignalized crossing. Continue straight on the paved rail trail.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746041" lon="-74.08974"><name>35. Water Street crossing</name><desc>Walk across Water Street, then ride the gravel rail trail south to Plains Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.743053" lon="-74.092204"><name>36. Plains Road · turn right</name><desc>Turn right from the rail trail onto Plains Road. Cross the short road bridge and continue southwest on the public road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.740286" lon="-74.097618"><name>37. Locust Lane · turn left</name><desc>Turn left into Locust Lane. Your starting curb is a short way down this residential street.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.739953" lon="-74.097332"><name>38. Locust Lane · return to car</name><desc>Finish on Locust Lane at your starting curb space.</desc></wpt><trk><name>Spring Farm and the northern Mohonk carriage roads · Sky lakes &amp; Clove Valley</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.797085" lon="-74.178207"/><trkpt lat="41.796978" lon="-74.178148"/><trkpt lat="41.796844" lon="-74.178046"/><trkpt lat="41.796687" lon="-74.177895"/><trkpt lat="41.796608" lon="-74.177815"/><trkpt lat="41.796561" lon="-74.177761"/><trkpt lat="41.796029" lon="-74.177136"/><trkpt lat="41.795926" lon="-74.176997"/><trkpt lat="41.795824" lon="-74.176835"/><trkpt lat="41.7958" lon="-74.176766"/><trkpt lat="41.795777" lon="-74.176633"/><trkpt lat="41.795791" lon="-74.176461"/><trkpt lat="41.795859" lon="-74.176273"/><trkpt lat="41.795954" lon="-74.176049"/><trkpt lat="41.796247" lon="-74.175875"/><trkpt lat="41.796384" lon="-74.175763"/><trkpt lat="41.796637" lon="-74.175448"/><trkpt lat="41.797407" lon="-74.17455"/><trkpt lat="41.797626" lon="-74.17427"/><trkpt lat="41.797804" lon="-74.174015"/><trkpt lat="41.797947" lon="-74.173783"/><trkpt lat="41.79798" lon="-74.173729"/><trkpt lat="41.79